{"seq":3,"slug":"bose-einstein-statistics","title":"玻色–爱因斯坦统计：预言一种新物态","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/core-contributions/quantum-and-statistical-physics/bose-einstein-statistics","wordCount":1438,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"玻色-爱因斯坦统计-预言一种新物态\">玻色–爱因斯坦统计：预言一种新物态</h1><p>1924 年，印度达卡大学一位不知名的青年讲师玻色（Satyendra Nath Bose）寄给爱因斯坦一篇论文，用一种全新的计数方法重新推导了普朗克的黑体辐射定律。多家期刊都拒绝了它。爱因斯坦却敏锐地意识到其价值，亲自把它译成德文并推荐发表，随后又将这套方法推广到有质量的粒子，由此诞生了量子统计的一个分支——玻色–爱因斯坦统计，并预言了一种当时无人见过的物态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>量子世界的粒子分为两大类，区别在于它们的全同性如何影响统计计数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>玻色子（boson）</strong>：自旋为整数的粒子（如光子、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>He 原子），多个玻色子可以占据同一个量子态，不受限制。</li>\n<li><strong>费米子（fermion）</strong>：自旋为半整数的粒子（如电子、质子），遵守泡利不相容原理，同一量子态最多容纳一个。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>玻色–爱因斯坦统计描述的就是全同玻色子系统的分布规律。玻色的创新在于：他把光量子当作不可区分的全同粒子来计数，放弃了经典统计中&quot;每个粒子都贴有标签&quot;的假设。正是这种不可区分性，导致了与经典截然不同的统计行为。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[全同粒子] --&gt; B{自旋}&#10;    B --&gt;|整数| C[玻色子]&#10;    B --&gt;|半整数| D[费米子]&#10;    C --&gt; E[玻色-爱因斯坦统计]&#10;    D --&gt; F[费米-狄拉克统计]&#10;    E --&gt; G[可共占同一量子态]&#10;    G --&gt; H[极低温下凝聚到基态]&#10;    H --&gt; I[玻色-爱因斯坦凝聚 BEC]\">graph TD\n    A[全同粒子] --&gt; B{自旋}\n    B --&gt;|整数| C[玻色子]\n    B --&gt;|半整数| D[费米子]\n    C --&gt; E[玻色-爱因斯坦统计]\n    D --&gt; F[费米-狄拉克统计]\n    E --&gt; G[可共占同一量子态]\n    G --&gt; H[极低温下凝聚到基态]\n    H --&gt; I[玻色-爱因斯坦凝聚 BEC]</pre><p>下表对比三种统计分布：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>统计</th>\n<th>适用粒子</th>\n<th>同态占据</th>\n<th>分布函数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>麦克斯韦–玻尔兹曼</td>\n<td>可区分经典粒子</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-(E-\\mu)/k_B T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>玻色–爱因斯坦</td>\n<td>玻色子</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dfrac{1}{e^{(E-\\mu)/k_B T} - 1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1088em;vertical-align:-0.7873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.296em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.814em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7873em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>费米–狄拉克</td>\n<td>费米子</td>\n<td>至多一个</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dfrac{1}{e^{(E-\\mu)/k_B T} + 1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1088em;vertical-align:-0.7873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.296em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.814em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7873em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分布函数与凝聚的预言\">分布函数与凝聚的预言</h2><p>玻色–爱因斯坦统计给出某能量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 的态上的平均粒子数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{n}(E) = \\frac{1}{e^{(E - \\mu)/k_B T} - 1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1088em;vertical-align:-0.7873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.296em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.814em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7873em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 是化学势，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是玻尔兹曼常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是温度。分母中的&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;是玻色统计的标志，正是它使得当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E \\to \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 时占据数可以变得极大。</p>\n<p>1925 年，爱因斯坦把玻色的方法推广到有质量的理想气体，发现了一个惊人结论：当温度低于某个临界值时，宏观数量的粒子会突然&quot;塌缩&quot;到能量最低的基态上，形成一团行为如同单个量子实体的物质。这就是玻色–爱因斯坦凝聚（Bose–Einstein Condensate，BEC）。临界温度可表示为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℏ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_c \\propto \\frac{\\hbar^2}{m k_B} \\, n^{2/3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3271em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℏ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2/3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是粒子数密度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是粒子质量。要达到这样的低温在 1925 年完全无法企及，预言因此沉睡了七十年。</p>\n<h2 id=\"七十年后的实验实现\">七十年后的实验实现</h2><p>技术终于追上了理论。借助激光冷却与磁阱蒸发冷却，物理学家把原子气体冷却到接近绝对零度。1995 年 6 月 5 日，美国科罗拉多大学博尔德分校 JILA 实验室的康奈尔（Eric Cornell）与维曼（Carl Wieman）用铷-87 原子，在约 170 纳开尔文的极低温下首次制造出&quot;纯净&quot;的玻色–爱因斯坦凝聚。几个月后，麻省理工学院的克特勒（Wolfgang Ketterle）用钠原子独立实现了 BEC，并观测到两团凝聚体之间的物质波干涉。</p>\n<p>康奈尔、维曼与克特勒三人因此共同获得 2001 年诺贝尔物理学奖。这是爱因斯坦一项理论预言被实验兑现的又一典型案例，距离最初提出已整整七十年。2025 年，物理学界纪念 BEC 实验实现三十周年与玻色统计提出一百周年，相关研究仍在量子模拟、精密测量等方向活跃推进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"意义与现代延伸\">意义与现代延伸</h2><p>玻色–爱因斯坦统计及其凝聚态，影响渗透到现代物理与技术的多个层面：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>宏观量子现象</strong>：BEC 是一团展现量子相干性的宏观物质，为在&quot;可见&quot;尺度上研究量子力学提供了理想平台。</li>\n<li><strong>与超流、超导的联系</strong>：液氦的超流、超导中的库珀对凝聚，都与玻色统计的凝聚机制密切相关。</li>\n<li><strong>量子技术应用</strong>：BEC 被用于原子干涉仪、原子激光、量子模拟器，以高精度测量重力与基本常数。</li>\n<li><strong>基础物理检验</strong>：超冷原子系统成为检验量子多体理论、模拟凝聚态模型的&quot;量子模拟器&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>玻色–爱因斯坦统计描述全同玻色子的分布，源于玻色 1924 年对光量子的不可区分计数，由爱因斯坦推广。</li>\n<li>分布函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{n}(E) = 1/(e^{(E-\\mu)/k_B T} - 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.138em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 中的&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;是玻色统计的标志。</li>\n<li>1925 年爱因斯坦预言了玻色–爱因斯坦凝聚，但当时无法达到所需的极低温。</li>\n<li>1995 年康奈尔、维曼与克特勒在实验室实现 BEC，三人获 2001 年诺贝尔奖；该领域在量子模拟与精密测量中持续活跃。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"photoelectric-effect\">光电效应：光量子假说的诞生</a>（同章兄弟篇）——玻色正是用爱因斯坦的光量子重新计数黑体辐射，才催生了玻色统计。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../relativity-theory/mass-energy-equivalence\">质能等价：E = mc²</a>（同 hub 兄弟篇）——无质量光子的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E=pc</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 关系正是玻色子统计最典型的对象。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../../../hubs/famous-people/richard-feynman/core-contributions/other-physics/superfluidity-and-weak-interaction\">超流与弱相互作用（费曼）</a>（其它 hub）——液氦超流与 BEC 的凝聚机制密切相关，费曼给出了超流的量子理论。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../../../hubs/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-foundations/qubit-and-superposition\">量子比特与叠加</a>（其它 hub）——超冷原子 BEC 是量子模拟与量子信息实验平台的重要载体。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"玻色–爱因斯坦统计：预言一种新物态","id":"玻色-爱因斯坦统计-预言一种新物态"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分布函数与凝聚的预言","id":"分布函数与凝聚的预言"},{"level":2,"text":"七十年后的实验实现","id":"七十年后的实验实现"},{"level":2,"text":"意义与现代延伸","id":"意义与现代延伸"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"布朗运动：原子真实存在的证明","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/core-contributions/quantum-and-statistical-physics/brownian-motion"},"next":{"title":"宇宙学常数与统一场论：荣耀与遗憾","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/core-contributions/legacy-and-influence/cosmology-and-unified-field"}}